WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
One mission. One team. Flexible tasks. Shared situational awareness.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:09.000
Command the mission. By text or speech. In your own words.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Review. Approve. Start. Review each assignment. Approve, then start.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.500
Explore together. Independent navigation. One shared map.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Drone 1. Drone 2. Switch the camera view and mission details.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Different roles. One team. Here, one follows. The other keeps exploring.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Keep control of the mission. Return home · Hover · FPV mode

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Inspect an observation. Open captured imagery for optional review.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:45.500
Your objective. Your team. One example. Configure tasks for your mission.

